%% Activity Diagram 1: Student Check-In Workflow
flowchart TD
    Start((Start)) --> A[Student opens attendance app]
    A --> B[System prompts for login]
    B --> C{Is login successful?}
    C -->|No| D[Show error message]
    D --> B
    C -->|Yes| E[Student points camera at QR code]
    E --> F[System checks if code is valid]
    F --> G{Is code valid and active?}
    G -->|No| H[Display invalid code error]
    H --> E
    G -->|Yes| I[System records name, course, date, time]
    I --> J[Display confirmation message]
    J --> End((End))

%% Activity Diagram 2: Professor Create Session Workflow
flowchart TD
    PStart((Start)) --> PA[Professor logs into system]
    PA --> PB[Navigate to dashboard]
    PB --> PC[Select 'Create Session']
    PC --> PD[Select course from list]
    PD --> PE{Course has students enrolled?}
    PE -->|No| PF[Show 'No students found' error]
    PF --> PB
    PE -->|Yes| PG[Generate dynamic QR code]
    PG --> PH[Save date and time of session]
    PH --> PI[Display QR code on screen]
    PI --> PEnd((End))
